    h1 Plugins
    <p>Any plugins we use should be listed here, Plugins should be under the MIT license. if you need a plugin that is not under the MIT license you need to discuss getting a license with your component owner before using it.</p>
    <p>Make sure that the plugin is self contained and that it wont have any effects other than the ones that you need it for.</p>
